      "id": "claim_26dbafade9ad4217bf1e4a1f78168c11",
      "statement": "A thread’s durable sandbox binding is metadata[\"sandbox_id\"], while SANDBOX_BACKENDS is only an in-process thread-to-SandboxBackendProxy cache; metadata is read from inline run configuration first, falls back to the thread API, and fails open to empty metadata on lookup error.",
